ar","Ko-ashura"],"9":["Kd-dalail","Ko-ramadan","Ko-16ramadan","Ko-qadr","Ko-lastnight"],"3":["Ko-miraj","Ko-lastnight","Ko-mawlid","Ko-rabi","Ko-12rabi"],"8":["Ko-shaban","Ko-baraa","Ko-lastfri-shaban"],"12":["Ko-arafa","Ko-newyear","Ko-dhulhijja"],"2":["Ko-safar","Ko-safarwed"]}},"tables":{"days":[{"d":"Sunday","ruler":"Sun","ar":"الأَحَد"},{"d":"Monday","ruler":"Moon","ar":"الِاثْنَيْن"},{"d":"Tuesday","ruler":"Mars","ar":"الثُّلَاثَاء"},{"d":"Wednesday","ruler":"Mercury","ar":"الْأَرْبِعَاء"},{"d":"Thursday","ruler":"Jupiter","ar":"الْخَمِيس"},{"d":"Friday","ruler":"Venus","ar":"الْجُمُعَة"},{"d":"Saturday","ruler":"Saturn","ar":"السَّبْت"}],"chaldean":["Saturn","Jupiter","Mars","Sun","Venus","Mercury","Moon"],"exalt":[{"pl":"Saturn","sign":"Libra","deg":21},{"pl":"Jupiter","sign":"Cancer","deg":15},{"pl":"Mars","sign":"Capricorn","deg":28},{"pl":"Sun","sign":"Aries","deg":19},{"pl":"Venus","sign":"Pisces","deg":27},{"pl":"Mercury","sign":"Virgo","deg":15},{"pl":"Moon","sign":"Taurus","deg":3}],"exaltSrc":"Signs: Iḥyāʾ p.111 (“The Exaltation of the Planets”); degrees are the standard ones (the Iḥyāʾ gives Moon 3° Taurus on p.61; the others are not stated on p.111).","metals":[{"pl":"Saturn","metal":"lead"},{"pl":"Jupiter","metal":"tin"},{"pl":"Mars","metal":"iron"},{"pl":"Sun","metal":"gold"},{"pl":"Venus","metal":"copper"},{"pl":"Mercury","metal":"quicksilver"},{"pl":"Moon","metal":"silver"}],"mansions":[{"n":1,"en":"al-Sharaṭān","ar":"الشَّرَطَان","season":"spring","el":"fire","q":"inauspicious","p":214,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Sharaṭān — and it is fiery and inauspicious — there are valid in it such operations as pertain to the affairs of women."},{"n":2,"en":"al-Buṭayn","ar":"الْبُطَيْن","season":"spring","el":"","q":"unstated","p":215,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Buṭayn — and it is hot and moist — there descends into the world /fol."},{"n":3,"en":"al-Thurayyā","ar":"الثُّرَيَّا","season":"spring","el":"mixed hot/cold","q":"mixed","p":215,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Thurayyā — and it is a star of mixed substance — there descends into the world a spiritual force of mixed heat and cold."},{"n":4,"en":"al-Dabarān","ar":"الدَّبَرَان","season":"spring","el":"earth","q":"unstated (works enmity)","p":216,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Dabarān — and it is earthy — there descends into the world a spiritual force that works enmity, hatred, and corruption in the earth."},{"n":5,"en":"al-Haqʿa","ar":"الْهَقْعَة","season":"spring","el":"","q":"mixed","p":216,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Haqʿa — and it is mixed of inauspicious and auspicious — there descends into the earth a spiritual force that is at one time evil and at another mixed."},{"n":6,"en":"al-Hanʿa","ar":"الْهَنْعَة","season":"spring","el":"","q":"auspicious","p":217,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Hanʿa — and it is an auspicious star — then work in it the operations of inclining, /fol."},{"n":7,"en":"al-Dhirāʿ","ar":"الذِّرَاع","season":"spring","el":"air","q":"auspicious","p":217,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Dhirāʿ — and it is airy, auspicious, and gentle — there descends into the world a wholesome spiritual force, fit for the handling of the spiritual beings, for the beginning of good works, for the suffumigations, and for assembling in houses of worship."},{"n":8,"en":"al-Nathra","ar":"النَّثْرَة","season":"summer","el":"cold with heat","q":"mixed","p":218,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Nathra — and it is cold mixed with heat, auspicious mixed with inauspicious — there descends into the world a spiritual force that works upon enmity, hatred, the severing of ties, and the like."},{"n":9,"en":"al-Ṭarf","ar":"الطَّرْف","season":"summer","el":"water","q":"inauspicious","p":218,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Ṭarf — and it is a watery star, continuously inauspicious — there descends into the world a spiritual force that indicates the like of what has gone before, and its action is the stronger."},{"n":10,"en":"al-Jabha","ar":"الْجَبْهَة","season":"summer","el":"cold","q":"mixed (nearer good)","p":219,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Jabha — and it is cold, auspicious, mixed with inauspicious, and it is nearer to good than to corruption — in it one begins works of affection, and operations whose means lie near at hand, and going in to kings, and asking for what may be obtained through the fulfilmen"},{"n":11,"en":"al-Zubra (al-Kharthān)","ar":"الزُّبْرَة","season":"summer","el":"","q":"unstated","p":219,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Kharthān — and it is al-Zubra — and it is hot and dry, it is fit for the handling of the spiritual beings, and for setting up talismans in it, and for the treatment of the sick and the curing of the chronically disabled, and for selling and buying, and for going in to "},{"n":12,"en":"al-Ṣarfa","ar":"الصَّرْفَة","season":"summer","el":"earth & fire","q":"auspicious (middling works)","p":220,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Ṣarfa — and it is a star of mixed substance, of earth and fire — there descends into the world an auspicious spiritual force, fit for such operations as are middling."},{"n":13,"en":"al-ʿAwwāʾ","ar":"الْعَوَّاء","season":"summer","el":"hot, dry","q":"mixed","p":220,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-ʿAwwāʾ — and it is a hot, dry star, auspicious mixed with inauspicious — there descends into the world a spiritual force that stirs up desire and engenders in men love for women and union with them."},{"n":14,"en":"al-Simāk","ar":"السِّمَاك","season":"summer","el":"earth, dry","q":"unstated (works enmity)","p":221,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Simāk — and it is an earthy, dry star — there descends into the world a spiritual force that engenders enmity and the corruption of woman."},{"n":15,"en":"al-Ghafr","ar":"الْغَفْر","season":"autumn","el":"air","q":"unstated","p":221,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Ghafr — and it is an airy star there descends /fol."},{"n":16,"en":"al-Zubānā","ar":"الزُّبَانَى","season":"autumn","el":"air","q":"mixed","p":222,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Zubānā — it is an airy star, auspicious but mixed with inauspiciousness — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force of a thing and its opposite;"},{"n":17,"en":"al-Iklīl","ar":"الْإِكْلِيل","season":"autumn","el":"","q":"mixed","p":222,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Iklīl — it is a star mixed of auspicious and inauspicious — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that engenders enmity, hatred, and strife, and it works during it a thing and its opposite."},{"n":18,"en":"al-Qalb","ar":"الْقَلْب","season":"autumn","el":"water","q":"auspicious","p":223,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Qalb — it is a fortunate star, watery and moist — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that sets right what the preceding mansion has corrupted."},{"n":19,"en":"al-Shawla","ar":"الشَّوْلَة","season":"autumn","el":"","q":"mixed","p":223,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Shawla — it is an auspicious star turned aside by inauspiciousness — there descends during it into the world a mixed spiritual force that works during it a thing and its opposite."},{"n":20,"en":"al-Naʿāʾim","ar":"النَّعَائِم","season":"autumn","el":"fire","q":"auspicious","p":224,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Naʿāʾim, /fol."},{"n":21,"en":"al-Balda","ar":"الْبَلْدَة","season":"autumn","el":"fire","q":"inauspicious","p":224,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Balda — it is a fiery, inauspicious star — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that works upon enmity, hatred, the severing of ties, and every evil;"},{"n":22,"en":"Saʿd al-Dhābiḥ","ar":"سَعْد الذَّابِح","season":"winter","el":"earth","q":"mixed (inauspicious)","p":225,"judge":"When the moon descends into Saʿd al-Dhābiḥ— it is an earthy star, inauspicious and mixed — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that works during it hatred, enmity, and the severing of ties."},{"n":23,"en":"Saʿd Bulaʿ","ar":"سَعْد بُلَع","season":"winter","el":"","q":"mixed","p":225,"judge":"When the moon descends into Saʿd Bulaʿ — it is a star mixed in substance, auspicious mixed with inauspicious — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that works a thing and its opposite;"},{"n":24,"en":"Saʿd al-Suʿūd","ar":"سَعْد السُّعُود","season":"winter","el":"earth & air","q":"unstated","p":226,"judge":"When the moon descends into Saʿd al-Suʿūd — it is a star mixed in substance, of earth and of air — there descends during it into the world /fol."},{"n":25,"en":"Saʿd al-Akhbiya","ar":"سَعْد الْأَخْبِيَة","season":"winter","el":"air","q":"inauspicious","p":226,"judge":"When the moon descends into Saʿd al-Akhbiya — it is an airy, inauspicious star — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that works during it the severing of ties, seditions, hatred, division, and wars."},{"n":26,"en":"al-Fargh al-Muqaddam","ar":"الْفَرْغ الْمُقَدَّم","season":"winter","el":"water","q":"auspicious","p":227,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Fargh al-Muqaddam — it is a watery, fortunate star — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that works love during it, stirs up desire during it, and quickens souls with affection."},{"n":27,"en":"al-Fargh al-Muʾakhkhar","ar":"الْفَرْغ الْمُؤَخَّر","season":"winter","el":"water","q":"auspicious (outcome not praiseworthy)","p":227,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Fargh al-Muʾakhkhar — it is a watery, fortunate star — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force that governs during it operations whose outcome is not praiseworthy, as was said above concerning the inauspicious mansions."},{"n":28,"en":"al-Rishāʾ (Baṭn al-Ḥūt)","ar":"الرِّشَاء","season":"winter","el":"water","q":"auspicious","p":228,"judge":"When the moon descends into al-Rishāʾ — which is the Belly of the Fish, and it is watery and auspicious — there descends during it into the world a spiritual force of praiseworthy outcome;"}],"months":[{"n":1,"name":"Muḥarram"},{"n":2,"name":"Ṣafar"},{"n":3,"name":"Rabīʿ al-Awwal"},{"n":4,"name":"Rabīʿ al-Thānī"},{"n":5,"name":"Jumādā al-Ūlā"},{"n":6,"name":"Jumādā al-Ākhira"},{"n":7,"name":"Rajab"},{"n":8,"name":"Shaʿbān"},{"n":9,"name":"Ramaḍān"},{"n":10,"name":"Shawwāl"},{"n":11,"name":"Dhū l-Qaʿda"},{"n":12,"name":"Dhū l-Ḥijja"}],"note":"Night convention: in the Islamic reckoning the night belongs to the following day — “the night of Friday” (laylat al-jumuʿa) is Thursday evening."},"flags":[{"id":"L14-43","k":"metal-planet","t":"Iron belongs to Mars in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Venus."},{"id":"L14-45","k":"metal-planet","t":"Copper belongs to Venus in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Saturn, Sun."},{"id":"L14-51","k":"metal-planet","t":"Silver belongs to Moon in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Jupiter."},{"id":"L15-28","k":"metal-planet","t":"Silver belongs to Moon in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Mercury, Venus."},{"id":"I534.4","k":"metal-planet","t":"Silver belongs to Moon in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Venus."},{"id":"I537.7","k":"mansion","t":"Set in al-Sharaṭān, which the Iḥyāʾ (p.214) calls inauspicious — check the purpose fits the mansion."},{"id":"I537.9","k":"mansion","t":"Set in al-Sharaṭān, which the Iḥyāʾ (p.214) calls inauspicious — check the purpose fits the mansion."},{"id":"I1488.9","k":"metal-planet","t":"Gold belongs to Sun in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Mars."},{"id":"I1842.51","k":"metal-planet","t":"Silver belongs to Moon in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Saturn."},{"id":"I1986.4","k":"metal-planet","t":"Silver belongs to Moon in the Iḥyāʾ sign table (pp.119–123), but the working is timed to Venus."},{"id":"I203